<title>USA: Odyssey Partners creates aerospace hardware firm.</title>
<headline>Odyssey Partners creates aerospace hardware firm.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Odyssey Partners said Wednesday it had acquired Aviall Inc's aerospace division and a controlling interest in Tri-Star Aerospace to create an aerospace hardware distribution company with annual revenues in excess of $100 million.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
<p>An Odyssey spokeswoman said Tri-Star's owner retains a minority position in the company.</p>
<p>Aviall announced the sale of its aerospace division Friday.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
